Package: harbour-snapszer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: user/games
Priority: optional
Architecture: armel
Depends: libqt4-declarative (>= 4.7.4), libqt4-network (>= 4.7.4), libqt4-script (>= 4.7.4), libqt4-gui (>= 4.7.4), qt-components
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/smatkovi/harbour-snapszer
Description: Classic Hungarian Snapszer card game
 Snapszer (Snapszli, 66) against the computer or against other phones in
 the same Wi-Fi network, with three- and four-player Schnapsen variants.
 MeeGo Harmattan edition of the Sailfish OS and Android app.
